---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
import "./fonts.css";
import "./comparison-base.css";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang);
---

<section
  class="demo"
  data-demo="serif"
  data-comparison="type"
  lang={lang}
  data-reset-message={t(
    "Initial state restored",
    "초기 상태로 복원했습니다",
    "初期状態に戻しました",
  )}
>
  <small>NOTO SERIF / {t("TYPE LAB", "조판 실험실", "組版実験室")}</small>
  <h2>{t("Local history magazine", "지역 역사 잡지", "地域史の雑誌")}</h2>
  <div class="magazine">
    <div class="magazine-rule">
      <span>
        {t(
          "THE LOCAL / HISTORY & PEOPLE",
          "THE LOCAL / 역사와 사람",
          "THE LOCAL / 歴史と人々",
        )}
      </span>
      <span>01 / 2026</span>
    </div>
    <p class="magazine-kicker">
      {t("A WALK THROUGH TIME", "시간을 따라 걷다", "時をたどる散歩")}
    </p>
    <h3>
      {t("The streets remember.", "골목은 기억한다.", "路地は覚えている。")}
    </h3>
    <p class="magazine-deck">
      {t(
        "Before the market moved, this lane brought the whole town together.",
        "시장이 옮겨가기 전, 이 골목에는 온 동네 사람들이 모였습니다.",
        "市場が移る前、この路地には町中の人が集まりました。",
      )}
    </p>
    <p class="magazine-story">
      {t(
        "Every morning, shopkeepers opened their shutters to the sound of footsteps. Today, the signs have changed, but the narrow passage still follows the old rhythm. We walk with the neighbors who remember it.",
        "아침마다 발걸음 소리와 함께 가게 문이 열렸습니다. 지금은 간판이 바뀌었지만 좁은 골목에는 옛 흔적이 남아 있습니다. 그 시절을 기억하는 이웃과 함께 걸어봅니다.",
        "毎朝、足音とともに店が開きました。今は看板が変わっても、細い路地には昔の面影が残ります。その頃を覚えている近所の人と歩きます。",
      )}
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="specimen">
    <span class="letter" lang="en">
      H<span class="terminal top" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="terminal bottom" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </span>
    <div>
      <h3 lang="en">Old town stories</h3>
      <p lang="en">Follow the lanes where the market once stood.</p>
      <p class="localized">
        {t("Old town stories", "옛 동네 이야기", "古い町の物語")}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <label>
    {t("Specimen", "표본", "見本")}
    <input
      data-text
      type="text"
      maxlength="60"
      value="iiiWWW 0123"
      data-interactive
      disabled
    />
  </label>
  <div class="sample-wrap">
    <div class="sample" data-sample lang="en">
      iiiWWW 0123
    </div>
    <div class="guides-layer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>
  <p class="measurement" data-measure>
    {t(
      "Measured advances appear after fonts load.",
      "글꼴 로드 후 전진 폭을 표시합니다.",
      "書体の読み込み後に送り幅を表示します。",
    )}
  </p>
  <div class="numbers">
    <span>111.11</span>
    <span>888.88</span>
    <span>123.45</span>
  </div>
  <div class="controls">
    <label>
      {t("Size", "크기", "サイズ")}
      <input
        data-size
        type="range"
        min="24"
        max="72"
        value="48"
        data-interactive
        disabled
      />
      <output data-size-value>48px</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <input type="checkbox" data-guides data-interactive disabled />
      {t("Advance guides", "전진 폭 가이드", "送り幅ガイド")}
    </label>
    <label>
      <input type="checkbox" data-tabular data-interactive disabled />
      {t("Tabular digits", "숫자 열 정렬", "等幅数字")}
    </label>
    <label>
      <input type="checkbox" data-terminals data-interactive disabled />
      {t("Mark H terminals", "H 획 끝 표시", "Hの端を示す")}
    </label>
  </div>
  <p class="font-note">
    {t(
      "The editable width sample starts at 48px. The named face renders supported Latin; Korean and Japanese use Noto CJK. Other characters may fall back. Guides measure text in context, so shaping and ligatures can affect the ranges.",
      "폭 측정용 입력은 처음에 48px입니다. 라틴 지원 문자는 표시된 서체, 한·일 문자는 Noto CJK로 표시합니다. 나머지는 대체 글꼴을 쓸 수 있습니다. 가이드는 문맥 안에서 측정하므로 연결 형태와 합자가 범위에 영향을 줄 수 있습니다.",
      "編集できる幅の見本は48pxから始まります。対応するラテン文字は表示の書体、韓国語と日本語はNoto CJKで表示します。ほかは代替書体になる場合があります。ガイドは文脈内で測定するため、接続や合字が範囲に影響する場合があります。",
    )}
  </p>
  <button class="reset" type="button" data-reset data-interactive disabled>
    {t("Reset", "초기화", "リセット")}
  </button>
  <p role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
</section>
<script>
  import { mountType } from "./type-behavior";
  mountType("serif");
</script>
<style>
  .demo {
    container-type: inline-size;
    background: #f8f4e9;
    color: #353a35;
  }
  .magazine {
    padding: clamp(18px, 4vw, 44px);
    margin-block: 28px;
    background: #fffdf8;
    border: 1px solid #ccc2af;
  }
  .magazine-rule {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    border-block: 1px solid #4e4a42;
    padding: 12px 0;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
  }
  .magazine-kicker {
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
  }
  .magazine h3,
  .magazine-deck,
  .magazine-story {
    font-family: "Demo Serif", var(--demo-serif-cjk, serif), serif;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .magazine h3 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.7rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  .magazine-deck {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    max-width: 35ch;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .magazine-story {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    max-width: 55ch;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .specimen {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: center;
    border-block: 1px solid #b8ae9b;
    margin: 24px 0;
    padding: 16px 0;
  }
  .specimen,
  .sample,
  .numbers {
    font-family: "Demo Serif", var(--demo-serif-cjk, serif), serif;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .specimen h3 {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .specimen p {
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .letter {
    position: relative;
    flex: none;
    font-size: 140px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .terminal {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    left: 2%;
    width: 42%;
    height: 12%;
    border: 2px solid #b64c2b;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .top {
    top: 18%;
  }
  .bottom {
    bottom: 14%;
  }
  .demo[data-terminals="true"] .terminal {
    display: block;
  }
  .sample-wrap {
    position: relative;
    margin: 24px 0;
  }
  .sample {
    font-size: 48px;
    line-height: 2;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-all;
    min-height: 96px;
  }
  .guides-layer {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .guides-layer :global(span) {
    position: absolute;
    outline: 1px solid #897245;
    background: #e7daba44;
  }
  .measurement {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .numbers {
    font-size: 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-variant-numeric: proportional-nums;
  }
  .numbers[data-tabular="true"] {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .font-note {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .specimen {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  .magazine h3 {
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 8cqi, 5.7rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
  }
  .magazine-rule {
    border-block: 3px double #4e4a42;
  }
  .magazine-story::first-letter {
    float: left;
    font-size: 4rem;
    line-height: 0.85;
    padding: 8px 10px 0 0;
  }
</style>
